# This directory holds binaries to be copied into the dev container
# 
# Required files:
# - pnut_ts (Linux x86_64 binary of the P2 Spin2/PASM2 compiler)
#
# The pnut_ts binary will be:
# 1. Mounted to /tmp/devcontainer-bin/ in the container
# 2. Copied to /opt/pnut_ts/pnut_ts
# 3. Symlinked to /usr/local/bin/pnut_ts (in PATH)
# 4. Made executable
